                        ],
                        "form": "прови́дческих"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "11e0aa1b-dd66-3ecf-9101-367fbff40d04",
                        "entry_id": "1908ac59-188d-3d8b-a033-f4e98ceb7c2e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "высок. свойственный провидцу"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "df1ad3a6-2a9c-40a7-8edc-9ba93cce87d7",
                                "sense_id": "11e0aa1b-dd66-3ecf-9101-367fbff40d04",
                                "text": "Карамзин, с его особым провидческим чутьем, скорее не разумом, а чувством угадывает внутренний нерв событий."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b106cba0-e6da-338b-a3d5-31d5ebfdc79c",
                        "entry_id": "1908ac59-188d-3d8b-a033-f4e98ceb7c2e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "высок. представляющий собой прови́дение"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d97bbef6-4c60-48ef-b1fc-403dc21cff27",
                                "sense_id": "b106cba0-e6da-338b-a3d5-31d5ebfdc79c",
                                "text": "И сейчас Зенон, вспомнив, вернее услышав тот давний возглас старика, подумал, что возглас его был провидческим."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "05069f07-6037-46d4-94cf-666634c5cc0e",
                        "source_entry_id": "1908ac59-188d-3d8b-a033-f4e98ceb7c2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "prophetic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prophetic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24f1be3f-e483-397b-8684-80d04e90cc9e",
                                        "entry_id": "43c102be-b8cd-3078-a886-07a640b0e17c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the ability to prophesize; prescient."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bc3c274-0e40-4638-81cd-8e81039e2cb3",
                                                "sense_id": "24f1be3f-e483-397b-8684-80d04e90cc9e",
                                                "text": "[Ghost] But know thou noble Youth: he that did sting / Thy fathers heart, now weares his Crowne. / Ham. O my prophetike soule, my uncle! my uncle!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6393b0bb-654c-3a1a-bcdd-972f6a80a49a",
                                        "entry_id": "43c102be-b8cd-3078-a886-07a640b0e17c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, or relating to a prophecy or a prophet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "844224cf-aa1f-3c8e-ad91-fa7de438d32a",
                                        "entry_id": "43c102be-b8cd-3078-a886-07a640b0e17c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Predicted, as by a prophecy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c85db54c-cecf-4037-b67c-f8fad9510515",
                                                "sense_id": "844224cf-aa1f-3c8e-ad91-fa7de438d32a",
                                                "text": "And fears are oft prophetic of the event."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1e34cb43-6de8-4051-8156-6dbc75ceb8b1",
                        "source_entry_id": "1908ac59-188d-3d8b-a033-f4e98ceb7c2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "prophetical",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prophetical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a73c770d-2de5-37b6-b26f-8afe611baa11",
                                        "entry_id": "cbaf6a99-94a2-33e5-999e-6caf25a1ba9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "prophetic"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abe6e922-ee02-4b67-95a5-9dcf6e0f6c79",
                                                "sense_id": "a73c770d-2de5-37b6-b26f-8afe611baa11",
                                                "text": "Why la; I knew't, this Propheticall tongue of mine never faild me; my mother was halfe a witch, never any thing that ſhe foreſpake, but came to paſſe: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0528897e-ab17-4f7e-bdf7-b0a428c486ee",
                        "source_entry_id": "1908ac59-188d-3d8b-a033-f4e98ceb7c2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "predictory",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "predictory",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "487ffeaa-80df-37a3-bb9e-8066aab26157",
                                        "entry_id": "ac0e52c4-765b-31ea-a030-cc79aaf4a873",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Serving to predict; predictive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4920634c-61a6-42e4-a59f-e183e1fd25e5",
                                                "sense_id": "487ffeaa-80df-37a3-bb9e-8066aab26157",
                                                "text": "his font name then given him, as predictory of those victories he afterwards got"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d0db4184-15cc-48c3-912f-e7d8b39411c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "1908ac59-188d-3d8b-a033-f4e98ceb7c2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "predictive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "predictive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f3da0be-7961-36c1-bf22-8eeb389d2a4e",
                                        "entry_id": "5ec55547-22eb-3b2d-9c6c-906d2ba2d4d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Useful in predicting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12ebb68c-7ae1-4d36-a9ad-12a0f87683e3",
                                                "sense_id": "7f3da0be-7961-36c1-bf22-8eeb389d2a4e",
                                                "text": "The amount of rain in April is predictive of the number of mosquitoes in May."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7afc01fb-0296-3bd9-93ff-50cd22455138",
                                        "entry_id": "5ec55547-22eb-3b2d-9c6c-906d2ba2d4d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Describing a predictor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87d9d74d-c739-38aa-bd66-6c7ad9fd28bc",
                                        "entry_id": "5ec55547-22eb-3b2d-9c6c-906d2ba2d4d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Expressing the expected accuracy of a statistical measure or of a diagnostic test."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "predictive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71af16e2-d55f-357a-a418-3b809c1ce960",
                                        "entry_id": "f5dff96e-aa8f-3a57-9a5c-01cf26e91a3e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A conditional statement that includes a prediction in the dependent clause (e.g. \\\"if it rains, the game will be cancelled\\\", \\\"give her an inch and she'll take a mile.\\\")."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99a25cb3-aff2-437b-80ac-8684883a1650",
                                                "sense_id": "71af16e2-d55f-357a-a418-3b809c1ce960",
                                                "text": "Also, as we have seen in the preceding chapter, predictive conditionals show a high degree of integration thanks to the patterns of verb forms which are characteristic for predictives and which normally do not mix freely with other, non-predictive forms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4501ab7-a34e-44d3-8c9c-d031262c6810",
                                                "sense_id": "71af16e2-d55f-357a-a418-3b809c1ce960",
                                                "text": "In contrast, English-speaking children appropriately differentiate if future predictives from when future predictives, a distinction relevant for English but not for, say, German."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1eb29951-9ed9-319a-8644-7af67af922c0",
                                        "entry_id": "f5dff96e-aa8f-3a57-9a5c-01cf26e91a3e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Simulated data generated from a statistical model, based on the estimates for the real data."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9656ed1c-4365-4010-9f86-b38e092fdbad",
                                                "sense_id": "1eb29951-9ed9-319a-8644-7af67af922c0",
                                                "text": "However, the posterior predictives combine two sources of information: what we might term the structural effect of WIC participation as well as an unobserved correlation between the errors of the participation and outcome equations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9f124a1-9d1f-43b0-85be-5fa00367f227",
                                                "sense_id": "1eb29951-9ed9-319a-8644-7af67af922c0",
                                                "text": "Alternatively, we can use prior predictives to help define prior distributions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "822026af-be13-4df2-8147-5f5a0b5c966e",
